-- The properties every category was missing, for the seller to give if they like and for buyers to
-- filter by: a car's engine, power, customs and plates; a motorcycle's and a commercial vehicle's
-- own; a tyre's size; a home's bathrooms, building and condition, a plot's permit; a job's contract,
-- experience and languages; a service's reach; clothes' brand and colour, shoes' sizes; a bicycle's,
-- an instrument's, a pet's breed and age; a machine's hours. Shared properties (a material, a
-- colour, a brand, a kind) offer each category only its own options (category_attribute_options).
-- What a property's subcategories don't share moves down to those it fits: a plot has no rooms, a
-- bag no clothes size. Central heating, one of a home's amenities, becomes a kind of heating. Every
-- new property is optional.

